1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Cruind Ba Drui Mac Echdach, King of Ulster==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Also known as Cronn ''Badhraoi'''''
2 CONT
2 CONT * The chronology of Geoffrey Keating's Foras Feasa ar Éirinn dates his reign to 343–344, that of the Annals of the Four Masters to 356–357.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: * Inneacht daughter of Lughaidh was the mother of Caolbhaidh son of Cronn Badhraoi; and he was slain by Eochaid Mugmedon. 
2 CONT
