1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ferchar_Fota
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ferchar Fota''' (the Long), King of Dalriada (c630-697), was seventh in descend from Loarn, brother of Fergus Mór. He was King of Dalriada (about 677). He seized the throne of Dalriada and "held it precariously against the Brit
2 CONC ons and Clan Gabhran for almost 20 years." After his death, his sons fought each other for the throne, until Selbach murdered his brother.
