1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Succession of Kings from ''Book of Leinster''==
2 CONT formerly ''Lebar na Núachongbála'' section 97 {folio 337h). [https://celt.ucc.ie/published/G800011F/text097.html]
2 CONT '''In the original record''', lower case '''m''' or '''mc''' appear. In the list below, I've replace them with '''mac'''.
2 CONT ===Genelach Rig Ossairg''' ''(i.e., Generations: Kings of Ossairg)===
2 CONT # Dondchad mac Gillai Patric  
2 CONT # Gillai Patric mac Domnall
2 CONT # Domnall mac Dondchada
2 CONT # Dondchada mac Domnaill
2 CONT # Domnaill mac Gillai Patric
2 CONT # Gillai Patric mac Dondchad
2 CONT # Dondchada mac Gillai Patric
2 CONT # Gillai Patric mac Dondchada
2 CONT # Dondchada mac Cellaig
2 CONT # Cellaig mac Cerbaill
2 CONT # Cerbaill mac Dungaile
2 CONT # Dungaile mac Fhergaile
2 CONT # Fhergaile mac Anmchada
2 CONT # Anmchada mac Con Cerca 
2 CONT # Con Cerca mac Fhaelain
2 CONT # '''Fhaelain mac Crundmáel'''
2 CONT # '''Crundmáel mac Ronáin Rigfhlatha'''
2 CONT # '''Ronáin Rigfhlatha mac Scandlain Móir'''
2 CONT # Scandlain Móir mac Indfaelad
2 CONT # [Gap: Left Vacant/Extent: 1 Line] 
2 CONT # _______ mac Colmain
2 CONT # Colmain mac Bicne Cháich
2 CONT # Bicne Cháichh mac Lagnich Faelad
2 CONT # Lagnich Faelad mac Rumaind Duach
2 CONT # Rumaind Duach mac Conaill
