2 CONT     That the kings are the sons of another king's sister comes mainly from"Kings and Queens" Collins Gem. by David Lambert and Randal Gray. 1991. Harper Collins Publishers. PO Box Glasgow, G4 0NB. ISBN 0 00 458954 8A Diagram book 
2 CONC first created by Diagram Visual Information Limited of Kentish Town Road, London NW5 8SY
