2 CONT 32. Aed O Neill, King of Ailech (d. 1033).
2 CONT 33. Flaithbertach Ua Neill, King of Ailech (r. 1004-1030; 1032-1036).
2 CONT 34. Muirchertach Ua Neill, King of Mide? (d. 977).
2 CONT 35. Domnall ua Neill, High-King of Ireland (r. 956-980).
2 CONT 36. Muirchertach mac Neill, King of Ailech (r. 938-943).
2 CONT 37. Niall Glundub, High-King of Ireland (r. 916-919).
2 CONT 38. Aed Findliath, High-King of Ireland (r. 862-879).
2 CONT 39. Niall Caille, High-King of Ireland (r. 833-846).
2 CONT 40. Aed Oirdnide, High-King of Ireland (r. 797-819).
2 CONT 41. Niall Frossach, High-King of Ireland (d. 778).
2 CONT 42. Fergal mac Maele Duin, High-King of Ireland (r. 710-722).
2 CONT 43. Mael Duin (d. 681).
