2 CONT
2 CONT '''Findláech of Moray, or Findláech mac Ruaidrí''', was the King or Mormaer of Moray, ruling from some point before 1014 until his death in 1020.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married to Donada, daughter of Malcolm MacKenneth.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Children: Macbeth
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources and Resources==
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#FindlaechMacRorayMoray
2 CONT
