1 NOTE
2 CONT Mac Bethad mac Findláich
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Findláech found himself on the wrong side of the regal dispute with hiscousins. Findláech had married Dabda (Anglicised 'Dovda'), a daughter ofMalcolm II and sister of Bethoc (mother of the future Duncan I). Thisalliance with the 
2 CONC House of Atholl estranged him from his own line, theHouse of Moray, and his own brother eventually ordered Findlàech's deathby the hands of his nephews, Gilla Coemgáin and Malcolm.
1 NOTE King Findl&#225;ech of Moray
