1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Dufnjal Kjarvalsson (Dufniall Kjarvalsson)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Dufniall Kjarvalsson Tilnavn / fordanskning: Dufnjal Lokalitet: Irland. Relationer: Søn af den irske kong Kjarval.  Kilder: Landnamabogen: 321 
2 CONT
2 CONT 321. Askel Spindekrog, som var søn af Duftak, der var søn af Dufnjal, som var søn af den irske kong Kjarval, tog land mellem Stensbæk og Tjorså og boede på gården Askelshøfde. Hans søn Asmund var fader til Asgaut, som var fader ti
2 CONC l Skægge, der var fader til Thorvald, som var fader til Thorlaug, der var moder til Thorgerd, som var moder til biskop Jon den Hellige.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen]
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cerball_mac_D%C3%BAnlainge]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Cellach mac Cerbaill (nicknamed Cellach of the Hard Conflicts) was king of Osraige from 905 to his death in 908
2 CONT
2 CONT Ceallach was a son of king Cerball of Osraige. He took part in the battle of Gowran in 893.[3] He came to the throne after the deposition of his older brother Diarmait in 905. Along with his son Muircheartach, he was slain in the 
2 CONC battle of Mag Ailbe fighting on the side of the illustrious king-bishop of Cashel Cormac mac Cuilennáin in 908. The Annals of Inisfallen record his death in 908:
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cellach_mac_Cerbaill]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ''Book of Leinster'', formerly ''Lebar na Núachongbála'' (Author: [unknown])  section 97 {folio 337h) [https://celt.ucc.ie/published/G800011F/text097.html] 
2 CONT
2 CONT "GENELACH RIG OSSAIRGE.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Dondchad m Gillai Patric m Domnaill m Dondchada mc Domnaill mc Gillai Patric mc Dondchada m Gillai Patric m Dondchada m Cellaig m Cerbaill m '''Dungaile''' m Fhergaile m Anmchada m Con Cerca m Fhaelain m Crundmáel m Ronáin Rigfhl
2 CONC atha. m Scandlain Móir m Indfaelad [gap: left vacant/extent: 1 line] m Colmain m Bicne Cháich m Lagnich Faelad m Rumaind Duach m Conaill m Corpri Niad Corp m Buain m Lamdoit m Amalgaid m Lóegaire Birn Buadaig m Oengusa Osrethi. m 
2 CONC Crimthaind Móir m Iair .m. Shétnai m Ailella m Lugdach m Labrada m Carthaig m Nuadat m Condlai m Bresail Bric.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Cerball dano m Domnaill m Dondchada."
