2 CONT ==Medieval Lands==
2 CONT FINDLAECH MacRory (-[1018/20]). Thane of Angus Mormaer of Moray. Orkneyinga Saga records that Sigurd Jarl of Orkney defeated “a Scottish earl called Finnleik”[113]. The Annals of Tigernach record that “Findlaech mac Ruaidhrí morma
2 CONC er Moreb” was killed “a filiis fratris sui MaelBrighdi” in [1018/20][114]. The Annals of Ulster record the death in 1020 of "Finnlaech son of Ruadrí king of Alba…killed by his own people"[115].
2 CONT
