2 CONT >a)         [https://www.geni.com/people/%C3%81ed-Findliath-mac-Niall-High-king-of-Ireland/6000000000350979840?through=6000000003512325053 AEDH Finnliath] (-Druimm Inasclainn 20 Nov 879).  The Fragmentary Annals of Ireland record 
2 CONC in 855 "a raid by Aed son of Niall to plunder Ulaid" but adding that "the Ulaid routed Cenel Eogain, and Flaithbertach son of Niall and Conacan son of Colman were slain there"[121].  King of Ireland.  The Fragmentary Annals of Ire
2 CONC land record in 862 that "Aed son of Niall, mortal enemy of Mael Sechlainn, took the kingship of Ireland after Mael Sechlainn…[and] held the kingship…for seventeen years"[122].  The Annals of Inisfallen record the death in 879 of "
2 CONC Aed son of Niall king of Temuir”[123].  The Annals of Ulster record the death 20 Nov 879 of "Aed son of Niall king of Temair…at Druimm Inasclainn in the territory of Conaille"[124].  m firstly ---.  The name of Aedh´s first wife i
