2 CONT      Donnchad Donn, High King of Ireland was the son of Flann Sinna, High King of Ireland. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 944. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Donnchad Donn, High King of Ireland was a member of the House of Clann Cholmáin. (1) He succeeded to the title of High King Donnchad Donn of Ireland in 919. (1)
