2 CONT Genealogy Context: Ferachar Foda (611–) -> Fearachar -> Ambcellach (Ambkellach) -> Donald Donn -> Donald Og -> Carlusa.
2 CONT Significance: Carlusa is part of the early, legendary, or tradition-based history of the lineage that connects to the later, more historically documented chiefs of Clan MacLaren and the Earls of Strathearn.
2 CONT Clan Connection: The MacLarens trace their ancestry back to this line, with the Clan name derived from Labhran (Laurence), who lived in the 13th century. 
