2 CONT Gruoch of Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen Gruoch (1007 - 1060) was the daughter of Bodhe, prince of Scotlandand thus granddaughter of the late king Kenneth III of Scotland. Gruochwas first married to Gillacomgain, Mormaer of Moray, to whom she bore thefuture king Lu
2 CONC lach of Scotland. In 1032, her father arranged her marriageto Lord Macbeth, member of Moray clan, who would become King of Scotland,or usurper, in 1040, reputedly through her hereditary rights.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is very tenuously the basis of the character Lady Macbeth in WilliamShakespeare's play Macbeth.
