2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Brian was a member of the O'Conor clan. His lineage can be traced directly to the present owner of Clonalis House, a beautiful mansion open to visitors. Died on Good Friday. The battle of Clontarf was a victory he won against the 
2 CONC Danes. After the battle he went into his tent & knelt to pray when some of the fleeing Danes slew him (axe to the head).
2 CONT
