2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT This monarch  of Ireland aka 'Boru'. Brian was a member of the O'Conor clan. His lineage can be traced directly to the present owner of Clonalis House, a beautiful mansion open to visitors. Died on a Good Friday. The battle of Clo
2 CONC ntarf was a victory he won against the Danes. After the battle he went into his tent & knelt to pray when some of the fleeing Danes slew him (axe to the head).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT The book, 'Ireland', by Knopf Guides
