1 NOTE OR "SIGTRYGG""OF THE SILKEN BEARD"; WENT ON PILGRIMAGE TO ROME 1028
1 NOTE [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT Sources: A. Roots 239, History of Morgan Family; Kraentzler 1406, 1409; Young; Simpson.
2 CONT    Also called Sitric amd Shitric of the Silken Beard.
2 CONT    Roots: Sihtric of the Silken Beard, King of Dublin.   Viking King of Dublin and first Christian King of Dublin. Went on pilgrimage to Rome in 1028 and died in 1042.
2 CONT    Simpson calls him Sihtric MacAnlaf. Gives birthdate.
2 CONT    Young: Sihtric Silkenbeard, King of Dublin, died 1042.   K: Sihtric MacAnlaf, King of Dublin, Man and the Isles. MacAnlaf, son of Anlaf, does not jibe with Roots re Sihtric's parentage. K. does not carry the line farther back.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: in Battle of Clontarf, Dublin, Ireland
1 NOTE KING OF YORK
1 NOTE [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT Sources: A. Roots 239, History of Morgan Family; Kraentzler 1406, 1409; Young; Simpson.
2 CONT    Also called Sitric amd Shitric of the Silken Beard.
2 CONT    Roots: Sihtric of the Silken Beard, King of Dublin.   Viking King of Dublin and first Christian King of Dublin. Went on pilgrimage to Rome in 1028 and died in 1042.
2 CONT    Simpson calls him Sihtric MacAnlaf. Gives birthdate.
2 CONT    Young: Sihtric Silkenbeard, King of Dublin, died 1042.   K: Sihtric MacAnlaf, King of Dublin, Man and the Isles. MacAnlaf, son of Anlaf, does not jibe with Roots re Sihtric's parentage. K. does not carry the line farther back.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: in Battle of Clontarf, Dublin, Ireland
1 NOTE [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT Sources: A. Roots 239, History of Morgan Family; Kraentzler 1406, 1409; Young; Simpson.
2 CONT    Also called Sitric amd Shitric of the Silken Beard.
