1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L228-6GM
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sbaldw.home.mindspring.com/Ireland/Osr/lists/Osraige.htm says "Aife ingen Fáeláin, wife of Donnchad mac Cellaig, d. 976, king of Osraige. ["Aifi ingen Fhaelain m. Cormaic, mathair Gilli Padraic m. Dondchada." BS 189 (Lec.);
2 CONC  "Aife ingen Faelain m. Cormeic .i. rig na nDeisi, mathair Gilla Padraig m. Dondcada." BS 228 (UM)] Aife was a daughter of Fáelán mac Cormaic, king of the Déisi (of Munster), who died in 966 [AU 966.1]. She was the mother of Gilla
2 CONC  Pátraic mac Donnchada, d. 996, king of Osraige."
2 CONT -----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Aife ingen Fáeláin1
2 CONT
2 CONT Father King of Déisi Mumhan Fáelán mac Cormaic1 d. 966 
2 CONT
2 CONT      Aífe ingen Fáeláin was the daughter of King of Déisi Mumhan Fáelán mac Cormaic.1 Aífe ingen Fáeláin married Donnchad mac Cellaich, rí Osraige, son of Cellach mac Cerbaill, tigherna Osraighe and Echrad ingen Matudán Dál Fiatac
2 CONC h.2,1 
2 CONT
