1 NOTE {geni:about_me} King of Osraige
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe
2 CONT
2 CONT d. 997
2 CONT
2 CONT Father Donnchad mac Cellaich, rí Osraige1,2 d. 976 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Aífe ingen Fáeláin3  
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe was the son of Donnchad mac Cellaich, rí Osraige and Aífe ingen Fáeláin.1,2,3 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also called Gilli Pátric mac Donnchada.4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe married Echrad ingen Carrlusa Uí Áeda Odba, daughter of rí Uí Áeda Odba Carrlus mac Ailella Uí Áeda Odba.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe married Máelmare Haraldsdottir of Dublin, daughter of Harald Guthfrithsson of Dublin.3 Lord of Osraige at Ossory, Leinster, Ireland, between 976 and 996.5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Annals of Ulster 996: "Diarmait son of Domnall, king of Uí Cheinnselaig, Gilla Pátraic son of Donnchad, king of Osraige, Cormac ua Congalaig, coarb of Daiminis, die. / Diarmait m. Domnaill rí H. Ceinnselaig, Gilla Patraicc m. Donn
2 CONC chada rí Osraigi, Cormacc H. Conghalaig comarba Daiminnsi, mortui sunt."6 
2 CONT
2 CONT Annals of the Four Masters 997: "Giolla Patraicc, mac Donnchadha, tigherna Osraighe, d'écc." (Gillapadraig, son of Donnchadh, lord of Osraighe, died.).7 Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe died in 997.5 
2 CONT
