2 CONC 3, ¶489].  [S278] A Descent from Adam, online http://www.geocities.com/Athens/Aegean/2444/Adam.htm, The Line of Condla mac Bresail, 113. Hereinafter cited as DfAdam.  [S335] Donnchadh Ó Corráin, Rawl. 502, 73, ¶489], ... m. Gilli 
2 CONC Pátric m. Donnchada.  [S334] Emma Ryan Vol. 1, Myriam Priour Vol. 2 & 3 and Floortje Hondelink Vol. 4, compiler, Annala Rioghachta Eireann: Annals of the kingdom of Ireland by the Four Masters, from the earliest period to the year
2 CONC  1616 (College Road, Cork, Ireland: CELT: Corpus of Electronic Texts: a project of University College, Cork, 1998), 997.2. Hereinafter cited as A4M.  [S897] [unknown], The Annals of Ulster, AD 431-1131 (College Road, Cork, Ireland
2 CONC  : University College Cork, 1997), U996.2. Hereinafter cited as AU.  [S334] Emma Ryan Vol. 1, Myriam Priour Vol. 2 & 3 and Floortje Hondelink Vol. 4, A4M, M997.2/.4.
2 CONT
