2 CONT Olaf was the ancestor of the Rulers of Orkney & Caithness. He established himself as King of the Norse Vikings in Dublin in 853. He and Ivarr the Boneless used Dublin as a base to raid the Irish coast and Scotland. Olaf defeated K
2 CONC ing Constantine of the Picts and Scots and demanded tribute from him.
2 CONT
2 CONT I henhold til irske kilder erobret Olav Kvite Dublin i 853 og ble kjent i Irland som Amhlaib Conung. Han hersket over landet i ca 25 år. Han og Unn den djuptenkte hadde minst ett barn, sønnen Torstein Raud.
