2 CONT Charles-Edwards, T. M. (2000), Early Christian Ireland, Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, ISBN 0-521-36395-0
2 CONT Gearoid Mac Niocaill (1972), Ireland before the Vikings, Dublin: Gill and Macmillan
2 CONT Dáibhí Ó Cróinín (2005), A New History of Ireland, Volume One, Oxford: Oxford University Press
