2 CONT
2 CONT =Laxdæla saga=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Kunz, Keneva (2000). "The Saga of the People of Laxardal". In Smiley, Jane. The Sagas of the Icelanders. Viking. pp. 270–421. ISBN 0-670-89040-5. ; also "The Vinland Sagas," pp. 626–676
2 CONT * Magnusson, Magnus; Pálsson, Hermann (1969). Laxdæla Saga (preview). Penguin. ISBN 0-14-044218-9.
2 CONT * Njordur P. Njardvik cand. mag. Laxdaela saga Prentsmidjan Oddi 1970 Note s. 24
2 CONT
