2 CONC ottir/6000000003827374118?through=6000000000161219866 GROA], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Thorstein-the-Red-Olafsson/6000000000161219866?through=6000000003827374118 THORSTEIN "the Red"].'''  Dungad & his wife had one c
