1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Additional Ban Shenchus entries of uncertain relevance  There are two additional entries in the Ban Shenchus, each showing a daughter of an otherwise unidentified Gilla Pátraic, a name common in the Osraige dynasty
2 CONC . In the absence of further evidence, there is no good way of telling whether or not these women belong to this dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. '''Aife ingen Gilla Pátraic.  ["Echraid ingen Charrlusa m. Aililla ri hUa nAeda Odba, mathair Thaidc m. Briain & Aifi ingene Gilli Padraic, mathair Diarmada m. Mail na mBo, & Domnaill & Aimirgen hUi Morda ri Laigsi, & Echduind 
2 CONC m. Dunlaing ri Laigen & Aibindi ingen Dunlaing, mathair Domnaill hUi Fheargail ri na Forthuath." BS 189 (Lec.); "Aife ingen Gilli Padraig, mathair Diarmada m. Mael na mBo, & Amargein U Morda rig Laigsi, & Eachduind m. Dunlaing, ri
2 CONC  Laigen & Aibinde ingene Dunlaing, mathair Domnaill ... rig Fortuath Laigen." (preceded by an entry on Eacrad ingen Carlosa m. Oililla without the ampersand before Aife) BS 228 (UM)]'''  http://sbaldw.home.mindspring.com/Ireland/O
