2 CONT Tadg mac Gillai Pátraic was the son of Gilla Pátraic mac Donnchada, tigherna Osraighe and Echrad ingen Carrlusa Uí Áeda Odba.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also called Tadg mac Gillapatrick cenél Áengus.2 Tadg mac Gillai Pátraic was blinded by Donnchad son of Gilla Pátraic, king of Osraige, in 1027.3 Annals of Ulster 1027: "Tadc son of Gilla Pátraic was blinded by Donnchad son of Gil
2 CONC la Pátraic, king of Osraige. / Tadhg m. Gilla Patraicc do dhallad la Donnchad m. Gilla Patraicc, ri Osraigi."3 
