2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Alpín, mac Eochaid, King of Dal Riada, Argyll, Kintyre
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpin_II_of_Dalriada
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.burkes-peerage.net/articles/scotland/page31d.aspx
