2 CONT Page 44:
2 CONT
2 CONT 16.    Donald II (Dommall), killed 900; King of Scots from 889.  By now the kingdom was being called Alban after Albanacht, mythical son of Brude, the King of Picts who so badly mauled the Scots under Babran in 560.  Donald was ki
2 CONC lled at Forres, in County Moray and was bur. on Iona.  A son of King Aedh,
2 CONT Constantine II, ruled until 943, when Malcolm succeded.
2 CONT
