2 CONC vard, Hlodver, Liot and Skule" as sons of Thorfin "Hausakljufer"[853].  Orkneyinga Saga records that “Skuli, Ljot´s brother” was given “the title earl by the King of Scots”, before going north to Caithness from where he sailed to 
