2 CONT #https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mór_ingen_Taidhg_an_Tuir
2 CONT # https://homepages.rootsweb.com/~cousin/html/p330.htm#i23707 Rígan Érenn Mór ingen Taidg Uí Conchobair was the daughter of Tadg na t-Tri t-Tor, rí Connacht and Cressa ingen Aurchada Uí Briúin Seóla.1 Is this the wife of Murchad, 
2 CONC King of Leinster, (d. 972)? Annals of Tigernach 992: "Mór ingen Taidg maic Cathail maic Concobair, rigan Erenn, mortua est."1 Rígan Érenn Mór ingen Taidg Uí Conchobair died in 992.1
