2 CONC  Scottish earl called Finnleik”[858].  Orkneyinga Saga records that “[http://www.geni.com/people/Olav-Tryggvason/6000000003867333182 Olaf Tryggvason]” pressured Sigurd to accept baptism and returned to Norway with Sigurd´s son as 
