2 CONC rborgaill daughter of Tadg, son of Gilla Pátraic, mother of [https://www.geni.com/people/Muirchertach-H%C3%BAa-Br%C3%AD%C3%A1in-king-of-Ireland/6000000079365095989?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1529257106032&through=6000000079364947085
2 CONC  Muirchertach Húa Bríáin king of Ireland]…rested in Glendalough” in 1098[753].  m [https://www.geni.com/people/Toirdelbach-king-of-munster/6000000079364947085?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1529257106032&through=6000000079364947085 TOIR
2 CONC DELBACH], son of TADGH & his wife --- ([1008/09]-Cenn Coradh 14 Jul 1086).  He succeeded in 1064 as King of Munster.''' 
2 CONT
