2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Farmer, David Hugh, The Oxford Dictionary of Saints. (Oxford: Clarendon Press, 1978), 96.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lapidge, Michael, "Cuthburg", in M. Lapidge et al, The Blackwell Encyclopedia of Anglo-Saxon England. (Oxford: Blackwell, 1999)
