2 CONC dh O'Brion, aodh o'brion, Eogan Srem King Of Connacht and King Eoghan of Connacht. Dui married Unknown. They had 3 children: Sennach mac Dui Ó Briuin, Congearvin mac Dui Ó Briuin and Duiniseach ingen Dui mac Muiredach (born Ó Briu
2 CONC in). Dui passed away in 502, at age 77 in Battle of Segais.
