2 CONT
2 CONT Owain ap Edwin, b. ca. 1044 in Llys Edwin, Llaneurguin, Flintshire, Wales, d. 1105
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Edwin ap Gronwy, b. 1020 in Tegaingl, Flintshire, Wales, d. 1073 in Northop, Coleshill, Flintshire, Wales Mother: Iwerydd verch Cynfyn, b. ca. 1024 in Powys, Wales Spouse: Morwyl verch Ednywain, b. ca. 1048 in Tegaingl, Fl
2 CONC intshire, Wales, m. Uchdrud ap Edwin, aft. 1105
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ednywain "Bendew" ap Neiniad, b. ca. 1020 in Flintshire, Wales, d. aft. 1079 Mother: Gwerful verch Lluddica, b. ca. 980 in Llys Y Coed, Cilcain, Flintshire, Wales, d. aft. 1070 Married. Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Angharad of Tegaingl, b. ca. 1065 in Tegaingl, Flintshire, Wales, m. Gruffyd, Prince of North Wales, 1085 in Ireland, d. 1162
2 CONT
2 CONT *Morwyl verch Ednywain born about 1048 Tegaingl, Flintshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT father:
2 CONT *Ednywain "Bendew" I ap Neiniad born about 1020 Flintshire, Wales died after 1079
2 CONT
2 CONT mother:
