2 CONT
2 CONT siblings: Bledrus ap Ednywain born about 1040 Flintshire, Wales Ceinfryd verch Ednywain born about 1044 Flintshire, Wales Robert ap Ednywain born about 1046 Flintshire, Wales Gruffudd ap Ednywain born about 1048 Flintshire, Wales
