2 CONT Morwyl verch Ydnywain bendew was named in full: Morwyl verch Ydnywain bendew ap Neiniad ap Gwaithuoed ap Gwrydr.1 She was born circa 1050. She was the daughter of Ydnywain bendew ap Neiniad. Morwyl verch Ydnywain bendew married Ow
2 CONC ain ab Edwyn of Tegeingl, son of Edwin of Tegeingl and Iwerydd ferch Cynfyn o Powys, before 1072.
