2 CONT Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes1,2,3 d. 580 Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes|d. 580|p294.htm#i10105|Frode IV Fridleifsson, King of the Danes||p111.htm#i13320||||Fridleif I. F., King of the Danes||p111.htm#i13321||||
2 CONC |||||| Father	Frode IV Fridleifsson, King of the Danes4
2 CONT      Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes was the son of Frode IV Fridleifsson, King of the Danes.4 Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes married Sigris (?). Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes was the successor of Ingild
2 CONC , King of the Danes; King of the Danes.5 Hálfdan II Frodasson, King of the Danes died in 447.6 King of the Danes at Denmark in 456/57.5 He was the predecessor of King of the Danes Frode V Skjölding; King of the Danes.5 Hálfdan II 
