2 CONT
2 CONT Harald Valdarsson - was born about 0568, lived in Jutland, Denmark. He is the son of Valdar Hroarsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Harald married Hildur Heidreksdatter about 0589 while living in Jutland, Denmark. Hildur was born about 0572, lived in Jutland, Denmark. She is the daughter of Heidrek "Ulfhamr" Angantyrsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	King Ivar Halfdansson "Vidfame" In Sweden was born about 0612, lived in Denmark and died in 0647 while living in Denmark . See #45. below.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. 	King Halfdan Haraldsson of Lethra was born about 0590, lived in Jutland, Denmark and died about 0650
2 CONT
