1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Audur Snorrisdotter (Aud/Unn Snorresotter)=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Also known as AUD FRA ISLAND'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * She lived at Barkøy in Norway
2 CONT * Aud was born on Iceland's daughter by Snorre Gode Thorgrimsson and Thurid Illuagidotter
2 CONT * She married Dreper-Bård (Viga-Barde (Viga = Drap)) He took her to Norway from Iceland. After a fierce quarrel, Viga-Barde left Aud and Miklagard, went into the guard corps and was later killed in a battle.
2 CONT * Aud / Unn married Sigurd son of Tore Hund at Bjarkøy. They had their daughter Ranveig
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Soga_um_%C3%98yrbyggjerne Kapittel 65 Soga about Øyrbyggjerne]
2 CONT
2 CONT "Daughter Unn married Viga-Barde; later she had Sigurd, son of his Tore dog, fraa Bjarkøy on Haalogaland; daughter deira was Rannveig, who was married to Jon, his son Arne, his son Arne Arnmodsson; son aat Jon and Rannveig was Vid
2 CONC kunn fraa Bjarkøy, who was one of the most gracious countrymen in Norway ".
2 CONT
2 CONT =Come from Iceland, daughter of Snorre Gode, protagonist in Eyrbyggja saga=
2 CONT
2 CONT * He is also mentioned in Njålssoga.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth year suggested as 985 or 1010.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Chapter 65 of Old-Age History says: Unni his daughter, he married Vigna-Bardi. She later had Sigurd, the son of Thor's dog from Bjarkey in Halogaland, and their daughter Rannveig, the son of Jon, the son of Arni Arnason Arnmod's
2 CONC  son, was;
2 CONT
2 CONT * His sister Unn he married to Slaying-Bardi; Sigurd, the son of Thorir Hound of Birch-isle in Haloga] and, had her wife afterwards, and their daughter was Ranveig, whom Jon, the son of Arni, the son of Arni, the son of Arnmod, ha
2 CONC d to wife; their son was Vidkunn of Birch-isle, one of the foremost among the barons of Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sagadb.org/eyrbyggja_saga
2 CONT
2 CONT * The life of Snorri Gods" says: "Snorri good had nineteen freed children who grew up ..... Fifth was Sigrid, sixth Unn; they were daughters of Thurid, daughter of Illugi red.  The source of her name is Aud is not known yet.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Snorri_godes_liv
