2 CONT    Earl of More/Moer in Norway and Jarl of Orkney and Shetland. He had his name Gallicized to Reginald. He supported King Harold Fairhair in an attempt to unify Norway.   Norr: Jarl Rognwald (Rogvald, Raonwald, Regvald, Rouis), cr
2 CONC eated Earl of Moer in 885.   Roll: Rognwald, Earl of Maere.   Norr: Jarl Rogwald (Raowald, Regvald, Rouis), Earl of Moer 885. Married Hilder.   Beyond Rognvald, things get pretty confused. Norr has about 25 generations going back 
2 CONC to Oden. RC doesn't agree. But some RC names coming down from RC's Odin agree in the upper portion.  But the dates are some 250 years different.   RC and Kraentzler agree in taking Rognvald back three more generations. Russell goe
