2 CONC er of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”[908].  Jarl of Orkney.  Orkneyinga Saga states that “according to some people, Erling, the son of Earl Erlend, was killed in the battle of the Menai Straits, but Snorri Sturluson says that he met his dea
