2 CONT Thori 'the Silent' Ragnvaldsson, Jarl of More is the son of Ragnvald I 'the Wise' Eysteinsson, Earl of More and Ragnhild Hrolfsdottir. (1) He married Alof Aarbod (?), daughter of Harald I, King of Norway and Gyda (?), circa 890.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thori 'the Silent' Ragnvaldsson, Jarl of More gained the title of Jarl of More. (1) Child of Thori 'the Silent' Ragnvaldsson, Jarl of More and Alof Aarbod (?) -1. Thoresdotter Thoresdotter
2 CONT
