2 CONC 15745571381?through=6000000003646023917 Ospak] was [http://www.geni.com/people/Thordis-Hallsdottir-Sida/6000000015746208028?through=6000000015745571381 Thordis], daughter of Hall of Sida”[906].  She married secondly [http://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/people/Sigurd/6000000017405673361 Sigurd of Paplay].  Orkneyinga Saga records that “his mother was married…to a man called Sigurd” when her son Magnus returned to Orkney, adding that she and her second husband had a son “[h
2 CONC ttp://www.geni.com/people/Hakon-Karl/6000000017405867140?through=6000000017405673361  Hakon Karl]…[and] a farm at Paplay”[907]. [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc268450047 (Cawley's Medlands)] 
