2 CONC nrz-RmKsRGrw&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiA9KzlvoLqAhXBup4KHfkmCvU4ChDoATACegQIARAB#v=onepage&q=Gudbrand%20Kula&f=false
2 CONT * Snorre Sturlasson: Olav Trygvessons saga, avsnitt 43. Mogens Bugge: Våre forfedre, nr. 477. Bent og Vidar Billing Hansen: Rosensverdslektens forfedre, side 77. 
2 CONT * Keyser, Rudolph, and Carl Richard Unger, ed. (1849). "1". Olaf's story of the sacred . Christiania: Feilberg and Landmark. p. 1. 
2 CONT * Ólafs saga hins Helga: A short story about King Olaf the Holy from the second, edited by Rudolph Keyser, Carl  - Rikard Unger - https://books.google.no/books?vid=OCLC05163436&id=u-F9Ami8McYC&printsec=titlepage&redir_esc=y#v=onep
