1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Torolv døde da han kjempet for kong Adalstein i slaget ved Vin Moor (også kjent som slaget ved Brunnanburh) under skottene invasjonen av England i 937, Han ble drept av Kong Haakons livvakt.
2 CONT
2 CONT About the year 900, Thorolf Skallagrimsson, son of Skallagrim Kveldulfsson was born. During his lifetime he made several trips to Iceland, had dealings with Eirik Bloodaxe and King Athelstan.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://duester45.deviantart.com/art/Thorolf-Skallagrimsson-65890191
2 CONT
2 CONT  About 937, he was killed on the battlefield of Vin Moor during a war with the Scots. He was buried by his brother Egil Skallagrimsson
2 CONT
2 CONT ENGLAND IS BORN ON THE BLOODY FIELD AT BRUNANBURH
2 CONT
