2 CONC f Kenneth, a most victorious king, reigned 30years through, On 1034 Malcolm King of Scots died.'
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: 'Ancestrial Roots of Sixty Colonists Who Came to New Englandbetween 1623 and 1650', 1969, Frederick Lewis Weis, p 111.
