1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dunclina -, the wife of Kenneth, Thane of Lochaber; and mother of (Shakespeare's) Banquo (possibly a fictional character anyway) - may have been the daughter of either Kenneth II, King of Scots, OR of Grimus. (Hist
2 CONC orical proof is equivocal, so initially [July 2011]  I created 2 profiles for her in order to document both possible options, hoping for further info to emerge. So far, none has, so I'm resolving the two profiles into one - a daug
2 CONC hter of King Kenneth II; sister of Malcolm II  [Sharon Sep 2012]. [http://www.geni.com/discussions/113428?msg=820235   See Discussion]
2 CONT
