2 NICK Princess of Deueubarth
2 NICK Nesta of Wales
2 NICK The "Helen of Troy" of Wales
1 NAME Nest //
2 GIVN Nest
2 SURN
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1085
2 PLAC Dynevor
2 ADDR
3 CITY Llandyfesisant
3 CTRY Wales
1 BURI
2 DATE 1136
1 DEAT
