2 CONT
2 CONT Diarmuid had two wives (as allowed under the Brehon Laws), the first of whom, our ancestor Mór Uí Thuathail (anglicized as Mor O'Toole), was mother of our ancestor Aoife of Leinster and Conchobhar Mac Murchadha. By Sadhbh of Uí Fh
2 CONC aoláin, Diarmuid  had a daughter named Órlaith who married Domhnall Mór, King of Munster.
2 CONT
