2 CONC g to starve the province's residents. Diarmuid was ousted from his throne, but was able to regain it with the help of Leinster clans in 1132. Afterward followed two decades of an uneasy peace between Ua Conchobhair and Diarmuid. I
2 CONC n 1152 he even assisted the High King to raid the land of Ua Ruairc who had by then become a renegade.
