2 CONT Painting: Gruffydd ap Cynan escapes from Chester, Illustration by T. Prytherch in 1900.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT     patron of bardic tradition, reigned 1081-1137
2 CONT
2 CONT     !Sources: A. Roots 176, 239; Kraentzler 1406, 1409; AF; Dictionary of National Biography;Young; History of
2 CONT     Gruffydd ap Cynan, King of Gwynedd, 1081. Weis says that his father's name was Conan. Morgan and Ancestral File say it was Cynan.
2 CONT
2 CONT     !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. Weis, Frederick Lewis. _Ancestral Roots of Sixty Colonists_. 6th
2 CONT     Edition. Baltimore, MD: Genealogical Publishing Company, Inc., 1988; line 239.
2 CONT     2.Family Group Record.
2 CONT     3. _Dictionary of National Biography_. Has 2 1/2 pages of details, beginning on Page 301. Says he had five legitimate daughters and several illegitimate children.
2 CONT     4. Morgan, Dennis. _A History of the Morgan Family_. "Griffith was born in Dublin and married Angharad, daughter of Owen. He returned to Wales in 1081, founded the first of five Royal Tribes, and was restored to the Crown of G
2 CONC wynedd in 1081. Griffith was imprisoned by the Normans in Chester, England, from 1081 to 1093 and is buried in Bangor Cathedral.
2 CONT     Children were Cadwallon, Owen, Cadwaladr and Gwenillian. From Owen's line came King Edward IV of England."
2 CONT     5. Jones, Arthur. _The History of Griffith ap Cynan. Manchester, 1910,a
2 CONT     translation and analysis of a twelfth century biography of Griffith (cited as thesource of the pedigree given in Weis, line 239).
2 CONT     6. Bartrum, Peter C. _Welsh Genealogies AD 300-1400_, page 41.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ragnhildir (Ranult) ingen Olaf Of Dublin b: Abt 1030
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Angharat verch Owain b: Abt 1065 in Tegeingl, Flintshire, Wales
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Married: Abt 1095 in Wales 4
2 CONT     * Change Date: 21 Sep 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Has Children Margred Verch Gruffudd b: Abt 1070 in Wales
2 CONT    2. Has Children Gruffydd ap Rhys b: Abt 1081
2 CONT    3. Has Children Gwenlian verch Gruffydd b: Abt 1090 in Caernarvonshire, Wales
2 CONT    4. Has Children Susanna Verch Gruffydd b: Abt 1095 in Caernarvonshire, Wales c: in <Gwynedd, Wales>
2 CONT    5. Has No Children Cadwaladr Ap Gruffudd b: Abt 1096 in Caernarvonshire, Wales
2 CONT    6. Has Children Owain Gwynedd Ap Gruffudd b: Abt 1100 in The Forgotten Monarchy of Scotland"
2 CONT
