3 CONT his mother → Margaret Holland, Duchess of Clarence 
3 CONT her mother →  Alice FitzAlan, Countess of Kent 
3 CONT her mother →  Richard FitzAlan, 10th Earl of Arundel 
3 CONT her father → Edmund FitzAlan, 9th Earl of Arundel 
3 CONT his father →  Richard FitzAlan, 8th Earl of Arundel 
