2 CONT  Owain ap Gruffyd, King of Gwynedd was born circa 1100.1 He was the son of Gruffydd  ap Cynan, King of Gwynedd and Angharad  ferch Owain.1  He married, firstly, Gwladus ferch Llywarch, daughter of Llywarch  ap Trahaearn.  He marri
2 CONC ed, secondly, Cristin  ferch Goronwy, daughter of Goronwy ap Owain.1  He died on 28 November 1170.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Owain ap Gruffyd, King of Gwynedd was also known as Owain Gwynedd. He succeeded to the title of King of Gwynedd in 1137.
