1 NOTE Randvér or Randver was according to Sögubrot and the Lay of Hyndla, the son of Ráðbarðr the king of Garðaríki and Auðr the Deep-Minded, the daughter of Ivar Vidfamne. In these two sources Auðr had Randver's brother Harald Wartooth
