1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Bárður "Svarti" Atlason'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Atli (Hoskuldssson) Höskuldsson and Salgerður (Steinolfsdottir) Steinólfsdóttir.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Birna (Aronsdatter) Aronsdóttir — married 1138 in Iceland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Úlfrún (Bardarssdottir) Bárðardóttir, Snorri (Bardarsson) Bárðarson, Aron (Bårdursen) Baardsson, Rognvald Bardarsson, Atli Baardsson, Sveinbjörn (Bardarson) Bárðarson, Ingolf Baardsson, Gunnar Bardarsson, Hoskuld Bardars
2 CONC son, Markus Bardarsson, Halbera Baardarsdottir, Oddgeir Bardarsdottir and Salgard Bardarssdottir Died 1140 in Selardalur Vesturbardastran, Iceland.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Landnamabogen_2 (99)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/#view=ancestor&person=94Y4-QHY FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 14 2018, 1:18:56 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Known people from Selárdalur include Bárður svarti Atlason (the grandfather of Hrafn Sveinbjarnarson), Páll Björnsson, Gísli á Uppsölum and Samúel Jónsson, the son of Jón Þorláksson frá Bægisá. Only one farm is currently inhabited
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sel%C3%A1rdalur
