1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Brynjulf Helgeson, på Aurland=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Helge Rannveigsson, På Aurland and N(?) Torsdatter Aurland 
2 CONT * Brynjulf ​​at Aurland in Sogn was lender man under Harald Hardråde (1015 - 1066). He represented the most powerful race in Sogn at that time.
2 CONT * He lived well around 1040.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. Svein Brynjulfson at Aurland.
2 CONT * 2. Serk Brynjulfsson
2 CONT * 3 Brynjulfdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Mogens Bugge: Our ancestors, No. 886. Bent and Vidar Billing Hansen: The family ancestors of the Rosens, p. 22. 
2 CONT * family: Scandinavian Historical Magazine 95/12 s 8
2 CONT * NST XXXI 1987 s 68: Ancestors of Losnaitte, by Anders Stølen
2 CONT * Gjallarhorn no 2 1988 p. 64: The Land of the Land, by Finn Wang
2 CONT
2 CONT
