2 CONC . Its inscription reads as ‘Æthelwulf Rex’ (King Æthelwulf). The ring on the right (2.6 cm dia.) was found near Aberford, West Yorkshire, in 1870. Scratched inside the bezel is an inscription that reads ‘Æthelswith Regina’ (Queen 
