2 CONT * 4.         '''GERLOC''' (-after 969).  Guillaume de Jumièges names "Guillaume et…Gerloc" as children of Rollo and Poppa, in a later passage records her marriage to "Guillaume comte de Poitou".  Robert of Torigny also names "Will
2 CONC ermum Longum Spatam et Gerloch" as children of "Rollo dux Northmannorum" and Poppa.  The Chronico Richardi Pictavensis records that "Heblus…Pictavorum Comes et Dux Aquitaniæ duxit Adelam filiam Rolli Rothomagensis", although this 
