2 CONT Eystein Glumra also called Eystein Ivarsson (dead ca 830 in Nord-Trøndelag, Norway) was Jarl (Earl) of Oplande and Hedmark in Norway, the son of Ivar Halfdan and the father of Ragnvald Eysteinsson. He was married to Åsa Ragnvaldsd
2 CONC atter.
2 CONT =-------------------=-
2 CONT 2298479410. Earl Øystein 2 Glumra of OPPLAND was born about 800 in Nord-Trøndelag.Norway.. He died about 846 in Nord-Trøndelag.Norway. Øystein married Ascrida Ragnvaldsdatter av OPPLAND. Øystein was employed as Earl of Throndheim 
2 CONC & Møre.
2 CONT
