2 CONC ancestor of Raoul de Toeny.   Eystein Glumra was the Earl of Moera (various spellings for this) in Norway and Jarl of Orkney and Shetland.
2 CONT    According to both the Heimskringla Saga and the Orkneyinga Saga, Eystein Glumra was the father of Rognvald. The Orkneyinga Saga says Eystein Glumra's earliest forebear was Fornjot, King of Finland and Kvenland. Fornjot's great-
