2 CONC died about 760. Sveithi's son, Halfdan the Old, who died in 800, was the father of Ivar, Earl of the Uplands. And Ivar, in turn, was the father of Eystein Glumra.   RC 44 calls this man Eistein Ivarsson, son of Ivar, who was son o
