2 CONT '''SIGURD Eriksson "Sleva" [Snog]''' (-murdered Vors [965]).
2 CONT * Snorre names (in order) "Gamle the oldest, then Guthorm, Harald, Ragnfrod, Ragnhild, Erling, Gudrod and Sigurd Sleva" as the children of King Eirik & his wife. 
2 CONT *The Historia Norwegie names "Siwardum Lioma" as third son of "Ericus…Blothex" & his wife.
2 CONT * Joint King in Norway.  According to Snorre, he was murdered in 965 by Herse Klyp in revenge for raping his wife. 
2 CONT *The Historia Norwegie records that "Siwardus" was murdered by the peasants of Voss led by "Wemundo Volubriot". 
