1 NOTE {geni:about_me} B.Brox: Sorry, new profile, - this time locked after someone merged the original into Snøfrid Svåsedotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Don't mix with her granddaughter, Ragnhild "The Wicked" Eiriksdotter! 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://lind.no/nor/index.asp?lang=&emne=asatru&person=Ragnhild%20Eiriksdotter%20%281%29
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.snl.no/.nbl_biografi/Ragnhild_Eriksdatter/utdypning
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From Harald Hårfagres saga: http://lind.no/nor/splitt.asp?lang=&emne=&person=&list=&vis=s_be_harald_harfagre
2 CONT
2 CONT Among them he had one wife, who was called Ragnhild the Mighty, a daughter of King Eirik, from Jutland; and by her he had a son, Eirik Blood-axe.
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT It is told that King Harald put away nine wives when he married Ragnhild the Mighty. So says Hornklofe: --
2 CONT
2 CONT "Harald, of noblest race the head,
2 CONT
2 CONT A Danish wife took to his bed;
2 CONT
2 CONT And out of doors nine wives he thrust, --
2 CONT
2 CONT The mothers of the princes first.
2 CONT
2 CONT Who 'mong Holmrygians hold command,
2 CONT
2 CONT And those who rule in Hordaland.
2 CONT
2 CONT And then he packed from out the place
2 CONT
2 CONT The children born of Holge's race."
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen Ragnhild the Mighty lived three years after she came to Norway; and, after her death, her son and King Harald's was taken to the herse Thorer Hroaldson, and Eirik was fostered by him.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT Kong Harald hadde mange koner og mange barn. Han fikk ei kone som het Ragnhild, datter til kong Eirik i Jylland; hun ble kalt Ragnhild den mektige, og deres sønn var Eirik Blodøks. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Folk sier at da kong Harald fikk Ragnhild den mektige, gav han slipp på ni av konene sine; det nevner Hornklove:
2 CONT
2 CONT Han vrakte holmryger
2 CONT
2 CONT og hordemøyer,
2 CONT
2 CONT alle fra Hedmark
2 CONT
2 CONT og alle av håløygætt;
2 CONT
2 CONT kongen den ættstore
2 CONT
2 CONT tok kone fra Danmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Dronning Ragnhild levde i tre år etter at hun kom til Norge; etter hennes død kom Eirik, hennes og kong Haralds sønn til oppfostring hos Tore Roaldsson herse i Fjordane, og der vokste han opp.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Don't mix with her granddaughter, Ragnhild "The Wicked" Eiriksdotter!
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://lind.no/nor/index.asp?lang=&emne=asatru&person=Ragnhild%20Eiriksdotter%20%281%29
