2 CONT * Nigel Tranter has a pretty good book on the subject as well, "Macbeth the King" and I found it far more readable than Dorothy Dunnett's. Tranter thinks that Thorfinn and Macbeth are halfbrothers, sons of Malcolm II of Scotland '
2 CONC s daughter Dovada (I think). And Duncan is their cousin - son of Malcolm II's other daughter Bethoc.<tigers14@aol.com>
