2 CONT Bethoc of Scotland was born circa 984 at Atholl, Perthshire, Scotland. She is the daughter of Malcolm II of Alba, King of Scotland. She married Crinan of Atholl, Mormaer of Atholl, son of Duncan of Atholl, Mormaer of Atholl, circa
2 CONC  1010 in Atholl, Perthshire, Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethoc of Scotland was also known as Beatrix of Scotland. She gained the title of Heiress of Scone. As a result of her marriage, Bethoc of Scotland was styled as Lady of Atholl.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Bethoc of Scotland and Crinan of Atholl, Mormaer of Atholl
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Duncan I 'the Gracious', King of Scotland b. c 1001, d. 14 Aug 1040
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Maldred, Lord of Allerdale b. c 1015, d. 1045
2 CONT
