1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ragnvald Brusasson''' (died 1046), son of Brusi Sigurdsson, was Earl of Orkney jointly with Thorfinn Sigurdsson from about 1037 onwards. His life is recorded in the Orkneyinga Saga. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Brusi Sigurdsson & perhaps  Ostrida Regenwaldsdottir We're Still looking for more Sources: [http://www.geni.com/discussions/139201?msg=966310 See Discussion]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife:  possibly a noblewoman from Kiev (Arlogia).  
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  1. Tora Ragnvaldsdóttir (mother of Magnus III of Norway)  2. Duvnjall (Domhnall/Gunnar) of Godey
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NB: Ragnvald was NOT the father of Robert I de Brusse, who came to England from Normandy.'''
2 CONT
