2 CONT Three brothers, one sister: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         SIGEFRID [Sigurd] ([750]-798).  First "King of Haithabu".  The Annales Fuldenses record that "Sigifridi regis Danorum" sent  "Halbdani…cum sociis suis" as missi to a council held by Charles I King of the Franks at "Lipp
2 CONC ia"[9].  One child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         HARALD ([750]-killed in battle in the Irish Sea 804).  Second "King of Haithabu".  m IMHILD, daughter of WARNECHIN Graf von Engern & his wife Kunhilde von Rügen.  Three children: 
2 CONT
