2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vikars Søn var Vatnar, som ligger i Vatnarshaugen; hans Sønner vare Snjall og Hjall, der ligge i Brødrehaugen. ([http://runeberg.org/detnorsk/1/0305.html Det norske folks historie 1-1], P. A. Munch, 1853)
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vatnar Vikarsson. King of Hordaland Vatnar was the son of Vikar Alreksson or Vikar Haraldsson His wife is unknown. He had the sons Snjall and Hjal and Imald and Eirik Vatnar buried in Vatnarshaugen, Bergen Skelfi was king of Voss.
2 CONC  His son was Skjøld, father of Eirek, father of Alrek, father of Eirek the wise, father of Alrek the bold, father of Vikar, father of Vatnar, father of Imald and Eirek, father of Gyda, who was married to Harald hairdressers. This 
2 CONC is called Skilfinge or Skjoldungeet. Vikar's son was Vatnar, who is in Vatnarshaugen; his sons were Snjall and Hjall, located in Brødrehaugen.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vikar's son was Vatnar, who is in the Vatnarshaugen; his sons were Snjall and Hjall, who were in Brødrehaugen. ([http://runeberg.org/detnorsk/1/0305.html History of the Norwegian People 1-1], P. A. Munch, 1853)
