2 CONC s burned together with fifty people" in 1032[227].]  m [secondly] ([after 1032]) [https://www.geni.com/people/Macbeth-King-of-Scots/6000000000307274753?through=6000000004533031237 MACBETH], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Find
