1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brian's first wife was Mór, daughter of the king of Uí Fiachrach Aidne of Connacht. She is said to have been the mother of his sons Murchad, Conchobar and Flann. Later genealogies claimed that these sons left no de
2 CONC scendants, although in fact Murchad's son Tadc is recorded as being killed at Clontarf along with his father and grandfather.
2 CONT
