2 CONT ----
2 CONT > '''Maen (Main) Leamhna MacMaoihtain''' – circa 365 – circa 444 AD
2 CONT
2 CONT > Son of Cork Maccon Maoihtain. Brother of Nathfraoch of Ireland.  He ruled the MacMiadachain with ruthlessness and was responsible for the building of several communities in the region of Carrick, mostly to the south and east tow
2 CONC ard Ayrshire and Wigtonshire and even into Britian (England).   One of his descendants was “Mor Mhoar Leamhna” the ancestor of the Kings of Scotland and the Kings of England from the Stewart (Stuart) Dynasty.
2 CONT
