2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Eva MacMorrough was born on 1145 in Leinster Ireland to Dermot MacMorrough, King of Leinster and More' (Moira?) O'Toole MacMorrough.  Eva married Richard FitzGilbert De Clare, Earl of Pembroke on August 29, 1170 in Christ Church C
2 CONC athedral, Waterford, County Waterford, Ireland.  They had 3 children:  Isabel De Clare, Countess of Pembroke; Gilbert de Striguil, 3rd Earl of Pembroke; and Joan De Clare.  Eva passed away on 1188 in Ireland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva MacMorrough De Clare, Countess of Pembroke is my 28th great grandmother.
