1 NOTE William was Duke of Normandy from his father's death until his own assassination. He was born in Bayeux or Rouen. A poem about his death entitled Planctus means that he was not born in continental Europe. which is probably true as
2 CONC  his Dad was a Vik
2 CONT William and his wife Sprota had 1 son,
2 CONT Richard, b 28 Aug 933 at Rouen, Seine-Infrerieure Normandy. William was WilliamI, 2nd Duke of Normandy. He was buried 18 Dec 0942 at Rouen Cathedral and later moved to the Abbey of Jumieges, Normandy
