1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Guttorm Sigurdsson Orkney==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Sigurd Eysteinsson, I, Jarl of Orkney and Grelaud of Caithness 
2 CONT * Guttorm Orkneyjarl was born around 870 in Norse Orkney
2 CONT * Guttorm Orkneyjarl died in 890
2 CONT * Guttorm Sigurdsson Orkney Orkneyjarl lived 46 years shorter than the average Orkney family member when he died at the age of 20.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Earls of Orkney - http://www.pickeringsofyorkshire.com/related-families/medieval/earls-of-orkney
