2 CONT
2 CONT He took over Westfold in 930 after brother Bjørn was slain by brother Erik. He raised Guthroth Bjørnsson as a foster child.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had taken over Ranrike in about 900 after brother Guthorm was slain by Solvi Klofi.
2 CONT
2 CONT After his father, King Harald Fairhair, died in 933 and brother Erik "Bloodaxe" took over, he and bother Sigroth agreed to meet the next spring in Tonsberg. Erik summoned a great force and sailed to Tonsberg and killed both Olaf a
2 CONC nd Sigroth in a battle in the hills east of town.
