1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Torgils og Frode gav kong Harald hærskibe, og de fór i vesterviking og herjede om i Skotland og Bretland og Irland. De var de første Nordmænd, som tilegnede sig Dublin. Saa er sagt, at Frode fik en banedrik, men To
2 CONC rgils var længe konge over Dublin og blev sveget af Irerne og faldt der
2 CONT
2 CONT FRODE.  Snorre names "Alof…the eldest…their son Hrorek, then Sigtryg, Frode and Thorgils" as the children of King Harald and his wife Gyda[81].  Under his father's division of territories, Vingulmark, Raumarike, Vestfold and Thela
2 CONC mark were granted to Olav, Björn, Sigtryg, Frode and Thorgils[82].  With his brother Thorgils, he plundered Scotland and Ireland, becoming joint king in Dublin, where he was allegedly poisoned[83].  
2 CONT
2 CONT http://lind.no/nor/index.asp?lang=&emne=nor&person=Frode%20Haraldsson
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NORWAY.htm#AlofAarbodMThoreRagnvaldssonA
2 CONT
2 CONT http://heimskringla.no/wiki/Harald_Haarfagres_saga
2 CONT
2 CONT http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harald_H%C3%A5rfagre
2 CONT
2 CONT Frode Haraldsson was a witness where Haraldr Hårfager Hálfdanarson, King of Norway bestowed Vingulmark, Raumarike, Vestfold and Thelamark on Olaf, Bjorn, Sigtryg, Frode, and Thorgils (four lands for five sons) in 900.2 King in 900
2 CONC .2 Frode Haraldsson was a witness where Haraldr Hårfager Hálfdanarson, King of Norway gave ships of war to Thorgils and Frode, with which they went westward on a viking cruise, and plundered in Scotland, Ireland, and Bretland.2 Fr
2 CONC ode Haraldsson died. It is said that Frode was poisoned in Dublin.2
2 CONT
