2 CONT Halfdan 'the Black', King of Westfold1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #150585
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=13 Jul 2005   
2 CONT
2 CONT      Halfdan 'the Black', King of Westfold gained the title of King Halfdan of Westfold. (1)
