1 NOTE Halfdan the Black, who drowned in 863 crossing the ice, was considered sacred, and his body divided among his four realms of Ringerike, Vestfold, Hadeland and Heidemark, to improve the crops as he was worshipped among the pagan go
2 CONC ds of Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Halfdan the Black (the Swarthy) was King in Agdir, etc, including the realms of ringerike; Vestfold, Hadeland & Heidmark.
