2 CONC of Atholl (-killed in battle [1045]).'''  He is named son of Crinan by Roger of Hoveden[1346].  Lord of Allerdale.  Regent of Strathclyde 1034/35. [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm  Cawley’s Medlands]
