2 CONC a 1030.3 He died on 14 August 1040 in Pitgaveny, Elgin, Morayshire, Scotland, killed by a blow from Macbeth.4 He was also reported to have died on 14 October 1043 in Bothnagowan. He was buried in Isle of Iona, Argyllshire, Scotlan
2 CONC d.4 
