2 CONC hip of the Scots, p. 37. 7. ^ Oram, David I, p. 233, n. 26: the identification is from the Orkneyinga saga but Máel Muire's grandson Máel Coluim, Earl of Atholl is known to have married Donald III's granddaughter Hextilda. 8. ^ Du
2 CONC ncan, Kingship of the Scots, pp. 33–34. 9. ^ Broun, "Duncan I (d. 1040)"; the date is from Marianus Scotus and the killing is recorded by the Annals of Tigernach. References
