2 CONC  divorce.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	i 	Gospatric Earl of Northumberland *-9901
2 CONT
2 CONT       		M 	ii 	Dolphin Maldred Prince of Scotland +-9902 was born about 1042 in of,Dunbar,East Lothian,Scotland. 
2 CONT
