2 CONC and and Ælfgifu (?), circa 1036.2 He died in 1045, killed in action, while attempting to avenge the murder of his brother by Macbeth.3
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of Lord of Allerdale [feudal barony].4 He held the office of Regent of the Kingdom of Strathclyde between 1034 and 1045.3
2 CONT
