2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Ivar-Kvite/6000000002325851160?through=6000000003645772914 IVAR] “Hvide/the White”, son of --- (-[1027]).  Snorre names "Ivar the White…a daughter's son of Earl Hakon the Great"[206].  Morkinskinna nam
2 CONC es “Ívarr hvíti…one of Saint Óláfr´s district chieftains”[207]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m ---.  The name of Ivar´s wife is not known. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivar & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >1.         [https://www.geni.com/people/H%C3%A5kon-Ivarsson-Varg-av-S%C3%B8rum/6000000003645772914?through=6000000003645825356  HAAKON Ivarsson] (-after 1065).  Snorre names Hakon as son of "Ivar the White"[208].  Morkinskinna na
2 CONC mes “Hákon” as son of “Ívarr hvíti…one of Saint Óláfr´s district chieftains”[209].  Jarl in Norway.  Captain of the Coast Defence in Denmark under King Svend II Estridsen [1048-1050].  Jarl of the Uplands in Norway under Harald Ha
2 CONC rdrada King of Norway [1054-1064].  Orkneyinga Saga records that “Hakon Ivarsson” had been exiled by King Harald and was “granted power in Sweden by King Steinkel”[210].  m ([1062]) RAGNHILD Magnusdatter, illegitimate daughter of 
2 CONC MAGNUS I "Godi/the Good" King of Norway & his mistress ---.  Snorre records the marriage of "Hakon Ivarson" and "[https://www.geni.com/people/Ragnhild-Magnusdatter-Princess-of-Norway/6000000003645772920?through=6000000003645825356
2 CONC  Ragnhild] [daughter of] King Magnus"[211].  Morkinskinna records that “Hákon” as son of “Ívarr hvíti” married “King Magnus´s daughter Ragnhildr”, dated to [1062] from the context[212].  Haakon & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>a)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Sunniva/6000000006906597206?through=6000000003645772914  SUNNIVA Haakonsdotter] .  Morkinskinna names “Sunnifa” as daughter of “Jarl Hákon”[213].  m ---.  One child: 
