2 CONC ://www.geni.com/people/Herbj%C3%B6rg/6000000003828029554?through=6000000017404551741 Herborg] whom [http://www.geni.com/people/Kolbeinn/6000000003828029548?through=6000000003828029554  Kolbein Heap] married”[955].  m ---. [http://
