2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#PaulIdied1098B
2 CONT
2 CONT PAUL Thorfinnsson, son of THORFINN II "the Black" Jarl of Orkney & his wife Ingibjörg Finnsdatter (-in prison Bergen 1098, bur Bergen).
2 CONT
2 CONT Orkneyinga Saga names “Paul and…Erlend” as the two sons of Jarl Thorfinn and his wife who survived childhood[309]. He succeeded his father [1065] as Joint Jarl of Orkney, jointly with his brother. Morkinskinna records that Harald 
2 CONC III King of Norway sailed to Orkney en route for his invasion of England in 1066 and “recruited the aid of Jarl Thorfinn´s sons Páll and Erlendr”[310]. He may have fought with his father at Stamford Bridge 1066[311]. Orkneyinga Sa
2 CONC ga records that Magnus "Barelegs" King of Norway “seized the Earls, Paul and Erlend” on his arrival in Orkney, “sent them east to Norway, and made his own son Sigurd overlord of the islands with regents to govern the earldom”, add
2 CONC ing in a later passage that Paul “was buried at Bergen”[312]. He was deposed and imprisoned in 1098 by Magnus "Barelegs" King of Norway, and died in Bergen according to Snorre[313].
2 CONT
2 CONT m --- Haakonsdatter, daughter of HAAKON Ivarsson & his wife Ragnhild Magnusdatter of Norway. Orkneyinga Saga records that “Earl Paul Thorfinnson” married “a daughter of Earl Hakon Ivarsson”[314].
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul & his wife had (five) children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. >>[http://www.geni.com/people/Ragnhild-of-Orkney/6000000007616425985?through=6000000000424848932 RAGNHILD] Paulsdatter .  Orkneyinga Saga names (in order) “Thora…Ingirid…Herbjorg…Ragnhild” as the daughters of “Earl Paul Thorfin
2 CONC nson” and his wife, adding that Ragnhild was mother of “[http://www.geni.com/people/Benedikt-Skoftesson/6000000008248200779?through=6000000007616425985 Benedikt], father of [http://www.geni.com/people/Ingibjorg/6000000017405426929
2 CONC  Ingibjorg], mother of [http://www.geni.com/people/Erling-the-archdeacon/6000000017405494243 Erling the archdeacon]” and “a daughter… [http://www.geni.com/people/Bergljot/6000000017405393428  Bergljot], who married [http://www.gen
2 CONC i.com/people/Havard/6000000017405651110 Havard Gunnason], and their sons were [http://www.geni.com/people/Magnus/6000000017405376866  Magnus], [http://www.geni.com/people/Hakon/6000000017405651138  Hakon Claw], [http://www.geni.co
2 CONC m/people/Dufniall/6000000017405678023  Dufniall] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Thorstein/6000000017405517760 Thorstein]”[956].  m ---.  [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc268450047 (Cawley's Medlands)]
