2 CONC  the Franks who  opposed Charlemagne. Killed 810. K: Gudrod Halfdansson.  RC Note: Moncreiffe adds two generations between Gudrod and Halfdan  Olafsson. He says Gudrod's father was Halfdan "the Stingy," King of Vestfold. And he ca
