2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of king Dag of Westmare.
2 CONT
2 CONT Liv married Halvdan Milde og mat-ille, son of Öystein Halfdansson and Hild Eriksdatter. (Halvdan Milde og mat-ille was born in 763, died in 802 and was buried in Borre, Vestfold, Norway.)
2 CONT
