1 CONT 63 Nathach: son of Crimthan Cass; was King of Leinster for 10 years; baptized in his infancy by St. Patrick. Had following children: 
1 CONT Owen Caoch, who is described below 
1 CONT Cormac 
1 CONT Faelan, who had a son named Fergus 
1 CONT Olioll 
1 CONT
1 CONT 64 Eoghan (Owen) Caoch: eldest son of Nathach. Had following sons: 
1 CONT Siollan, who is described below 
1 CONT Fergus, ancestor of O'Ryan 
1 CONT
1 CONT 65 Siollan (skinny person): son of Eoghan Caoch 
1 CONT
1 CONT 66 Faelan: his son; was King of Leinster for 9 years. 
1 CONT
1 CONT 67 Faolchu: his son. Had following sons: 
1 CONT Elodach, King of Leinster for 7 years 
1 CONT Onchu, who is described below 
1 CONT Aongus, slain in 721 at Maisden, Mullaghmast 
1 CONT
