0 @N6000000002176675522@ NOTE Columba's father was a kinsman of princes then reigning in Ireland and
1 CONT western Scotland. Columba studied under St. Finnian (468?-549?) at Clonard.
1 CONT About 522, Columba established Durrow Monastery, and, about 546, he founded
1 CONT Derry, later the city of Londonderry. The monastery is now in county Offaly,
1 CONT Ireland.
