0 @N6000000003949670022@ NOTE OSSORY A lesser state in southeast Ireland, a buffer kingdom between Munster and Leinster. It's extent is roughly coterminous with that of the modern Diocese of Ossory, based at Kilkenny. The term Ossory was essentially tribal - I
1 CONC rish Osraige signified perhaps "the people of the deer" (Irish os). 
