1 CONC   Genealogical Publishing Co, 1995)
1 CONT
1 CONT Brian of the Tributes.  King of the Dalcassians, then King of Munster (976-1002), and finally usurped the high kingship of Ireland (1002-1014).  Killed at the battle of Clontarf, 1014 A.D., fighting a mixed force of Norse and Lein
1 CONC stermen.  Brian;s ANCESTRY depends solely on tradition and is not accepted as prove.
