1 CONT
1 CONT [Brøderbund WFT Vol. 3, Ed. 1, Tree #4579, Date of Import: Jun 15, 2003]
1 CONT
1 CONT Brian of the Tributes (Borama, Boroimhe, Boru), King of the Dalcassians, then King of Munster (976-1002), and finally usurped the high kingship of Ireland (1002-1014).  Killed at the battle of Clontarf, 1014 A.D., fighting a mixed
1 CONC  force of Norse and Leinstermen.
