1 CONC s, dau of Murchad, King of Leinster (d 972).  Gormflait was the wid. of Anlaf (Olaf), King of Dublin (d 981), and had been the wife of Mael-Sechnaill, King of Ireland.  She d 1030.  (This ancestry depends soley on tradition and is
1 CONC  not accepted as proven).
