1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Acceded: 839 Died: 859, Forteviot, Perthshire Interred: Isle of Iona, Scotland Notes: Burke calls him Kenneth II. Kings of Picts & Alba. King of Galloway. See Europäisch Stammtafeln Bund II tafel 67.
