1 CONT Diarmait MacMáil na mBó, King of Ireland died 7 February 1071/72[2]. KFH LINK
1 CONT Diarmuid: 2nd son of Donoch Maol-na-mBo; was the 47th Christian King of Leinster, and the 177th Milesian Monarch of Ireland; was slain on the 23rd Feb, 1072, at Odhba, near Navan; married Darbhforgal (died 1080), grand-daughter of
1 CONC  the Monarch Brian Boromha.[KFH]
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Dearbforgail ingen Donnchada O'Brien, daughter of Donnchad O'Brien and Driella.
1 CONT
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT under Diarmait mac Máel na mBó, who ascended the throne of Leinster in 1042, the dynasty returned to the kingship 
1 CONT
1 CONT King of Ireland &Leinster - Acceded: 1042 King of Ireland &Leinster
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Diarmait na mBó and Dearbforgail O'Brien is:
1 CONT Murchad macDiarmata meicMáel na mBo, King of Leinster, died 21 November 1070 in Dublin, Ireland.
1 CONT
1 CONT 7. Domnall Remar macMáel na6 mBó died 1041[3].
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Domnall mBó is:
1 CONT + 9 i. Donnchad macDomnaill7 Remair, King of Leinster, died 1089.
1 CONT
1 CONT ===================================================================
