0 @N6000000003051286233@ NOTE King of the Scots 834
1 CONT
1 CONT He was killed fighting the Picts.
1 CONT
1 CONT [From Wikipedia: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpin_II_of_Dalriada]
1 CONT Alpin II (Scottish Gaelic: Alpin mac Echdach) (died 841 in Galloway, Scotland) was king of Dál Riata from 839 until 841. He was the father of Kenneth I and Donald I.
1 CONT
1 CONT Alpin was certainly dead by 841, when his son, Kenneth, took the kingship of Dál Riata. A late source states that he died in 834 fighting the Picts in Galloway. He did not succeed to the kingship of the Picts.
