1 CONC glish now, Malcolm and his new found friends marched on to stamp out the Scandinavian threat from Ireland. But in 950, with a little pushing from Monk Constantine, Malcolm moved into England and started taking the northern territo
1 CONC ries there.
1 CONT
1 CONT However, on his return from his crusade in 954, Malcolm had now found that his own northerly regions had revolted and in a brief conflict with them they killed him at Fordoun in the Mearns.
