1 CONT Murchad macDiarmata meicMáel na mBo, King of Leinster died 21 November 1070 in Dublin, Ireland[4].
1 CONT Murcha (a sea warrior, also called Morough): eldest son of Diarmaid; was the 50th Christian King of Leinster; invaded the Isle of Man in 1070; died in Dublin on the 8th of December, 1090.[KFH]
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Sadb ingen MacBricc, daughter of MacBricc.
1 CONT
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT King of Leinster - Acceded: 1052
1 CONT
1 CONT John Slayton - says he died 8 Dec 1070
1 CONT 1416 West Short
1 CONT Independence MO
1 CONT 64050-3536
1 CONT from LSD website 
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Murchad na mBo and Sadb MacBricc is:
1 CONT Donnchad macMurchada, King of Leinster, died 1115.
1 CONT
1 CONT 9. Donnchad macDomnaill7 Remair, King of Leinster died 1089[5]. He married Cailleach ingen MacFaelin.
1 CONT
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT Acceded: 1075
1 CONT
1 CONT Child of Donnchad Remair and Cailleach MacFaelin is:
