0 @N6000000003796138423@ NOTE [BIGOD-Mel Morris,10Gen Anc.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT OCCU Welsh princess ...
1 CONT SOUR gendex.com/users/daver/rigney/D0001
1 CONT Most of her descendants were variously known as Fitz-Henrys and Fitz-Geralds;
1 CONT The name of one of her descendants was Rhys, Prince of South Wales -
1 CONT The Conquerors,Thomas B. Costain, p. 183; A maid of Caen - COMYNJ.TAF (Compu-
1 CONT serve), p. 4; ...made prisoner during some fighting along the Marches -
1 CONT The Conquering Family, Thomas B. Costain, p. 9
1 CONT NESTA, daughter of RHYS AP TEWDWR and IESTYN AP GWRGAST'S daughter, was known as the most beautiful woman in Wales. She had many lovers. In Christmas 1108 Owain ap Cadwgan of Cardigan came to visit
1 CONT  Gerald and Nesta. He so lusted after her that he, that
1 CONT night, attacked the castle and carried her off and had his way with her. This upset Henry I so much that the incident started a war. - http://gendex.com/users/daver/rigney/D0002/G0000041.html#I835
1 CONT http://www.public.asu.edu/~bgertz/family/d0006/g0000083.htm#I3281 says parents are Rhys ap Tewder and Gwladus verch Rhiwallon - NPH[BIGOD-Mel Morris,10Gen Anc.FTW]
