1 CONT permission, he raised an army but died shortly after his Anglo-Normanarmy
1 CONT had reconquered his territory. This began the subjection of Ireland to
1 CONT England through foreign armies. Even the church capitulated and accepted
1 CONT the English/Roman changes in their forms of worship
