0 @N6000000002187913624@ NOTE Algaut
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Algaut (or Algöt) was a Geatish king who ruled West Götaland according to the Heimskringla. Snorri Sturluson relates that he was burnt to death by his son-in-law, the Swedish king Ingjald ill-ruler.
