1 CONC nish" wife. Under Treaty of St. Claire, 911 received the Duchy of Normandy from Charles III, "the Simple".
1 CONT died. was born circa 870 at Maer, Norway.1,2 He was the son of Ragnvald I Eysteinsson "The Wise" and Ragnhild (Hildir) Hrolfsson. He married Poppa in 886.1,3 His body was interred circa 927 at Notre Dame, Rouen, France.
