1 CONT
1 CONT Married to Sn¿frid Swasisdottir.  Children:  Halvdan HŒleg, Gudred Liomi (King of Hadeland), Sigurd (Underking of Trondhjem), Ragnvald Staightleg (King of Hadeland).
1 CONT
1 CONT Married to Swanhild ¯esteinsdottir.  Children:  Ragnar Ryckil, Bj¿rn (Underking of VŒstfold), Olof Geirsteadalf.
