0 @N6000000005083467556@ NOTE Born in 858.  Parents:  Halvdan the Black Gudrodsen, King of VŒstfold, and Raghhild Sigurdsdottir.  He united Norway.  Harald died in 934.
1 CONT
1 CONT Married to sa HŒkonsdottir.  Children:  Guthorm, Halvdan White, Halvdan Black, Sigfrod.
1 CONT
1 CONT Married to Gyda Ericsdottir.  Children:  Alof Arbot, Roerek, Sigtrygg, Frodi, Thorgils.
1 CONT
1 CONT Married to Ragnhild Ericsdottir.  Son:  Eirik I.
1 CONT
