1 CONT     He was mortally wounded by rival branches of the royal house.
1 CONT     King of the Scots. Williamson, in Chart No. 18, says he was King of Alba.
1 CONT     (Alba is Albany, modern Scotland north of the Forth & Clyde.)
1 CONT
1 CONT     OCCU King of Alba ...
