0 @N6000000004286975901@ NOTE REFN: P2084
1 CONT b. before 1028, d. before 1070, #104734
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
1 CONT
1 CONT Ingibiorg 'Earl's Mother' Finnsdottir was born before 1028. She was the daughter of Finn Arnasson, Jarl of Halland and Bergljot.2 She married, firstly, Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness, son of Sigurd II Digri, J
1 CONC arl of Orkney and Caithness and Donalda of Alba, before 1038.2 She married, secondly, Malcolm III 'Caennmor', King of Scotland, son of Duncan I 'the Gracious', Kingof Scotland and Sybilla of Northumbria, between 1059 and 1066.3 Sh
1 CONC e died before 1070.2
1 CONT
1 CONT Children of Ingibiorg 'Earl's Mother' Finnsdottir and Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness
