0 @N6000000001353851298@ NOTE Jarl of the Uplands in Norway 2
1 CONT Note: The Scandinavian Earls of Orkney trace their descent from the noblest and most heroic of the ruling dynasties of the north. Ivar, Prince of the Uplands in Norway, who claimed a descent from the deified hero Thor, was father 
1 CONC of Eystein
1 CONT Sources: A. Roots 121E; RC 44; Kraentzler 1593; Memoirs of the House of
1 CONT Russell (1833) by J.H. Wiffen (292.242, R911w, Vol. 1, Q Section).
1 CONT RC: Halfdan "the Old." K: Halfdan (The Old) Sveidesson.
1 CONT Roots: Halfdan, the Old.
1 CONT Russell: Halfdan the Aged. Has date A.D. 800. Think this is a date they were
1 CONT alive.
