1 CONT      Dafydd ap Llywelyn Fawr, prince of Gwynedd (1240 -- 25 Feb 1246)
1 CONT      Llywelyn ap Gruffydd ``the Last''
1 CONT           prince of Gwynedd (1246 -- 1282)
