1 CONT PLAC Acceded: 1185.  Princess of Leinster.One source shows her living in 1186, other sources record her death as "after 1174".
1 CONT 'The Genealogist' (Association for the Promotion of Scholarship in Genealogy),
1 CONT vol. I, no. 1, spring 1980. It contains a very encompassing and detailed article by David H. Klley dealing with the ancestry of Eve of Leinster, who married "Strongbow."
1 CONT Poetically speaking, Cahair Mar of the 4th Century A.D. would be 96th or
1 CONT 97th in descent from Adam and Eve--and #1 in a line that continues down to
1 CONT Eve of Leinster as #27.
1 CONT Countess of Ireland & Strigoil. Birthdate recorded as 1115 but assuming 1145. This individual has the following other parents in the Ancestral File: Dermond /MC MURSOUCH/ (AFN:G8BK-MN) and More
1 CONT  /O'TOOLE/ (AFN:G8BK-NT) King Of L /DERMOT/ (AFN:FLHD-12) and More /O'TOOLE/ (AFN:91SS-05) Dermot /LEINSTER/ (AFN:FSBN-F4) and More /O'TOOLE/ (AFN:FSBN-G9) Dermot /AOIFE/ (AFN:GS5S-ZX) and More
