0 @N6000000001783169785@ NOTE Rhys ap Gruffydd
1 CONT http://trees.ancestry.com/rd?f=image&guid=a23145ad-1d5b-44ad-ab34-3d755d753a78&tid=929940&pid=-2023991699
1 CONT
1 CONT Dinefwr Castle-Wales
