1 CONT Note: Sigurd, and/or his son Ragnar, took over Raumariki and Westfold all the way to Grenmar as well as Vingulmork during King Harald's reign. He battled at Bravellir with his uncle, King Harald "Wartooth" Hraereksson of Denmark a
1 CONC nd killed him.
