1 CONT Note for: William Longsword, 900 - 17 DEC 943 
1 CONT 2 Duke of Normandy
1 CONT Went to a small island in the river Somme near Amiens to meet Arnulph, Count of Flanders, to conclude a treaty with him. He was assassinated by his orders in 942. Named for the long sword given him at his coronation.
