1 CONT      Adele de Normandie was born circa 917.1 She was the daughter of Rollo Ragnvaldsson, 1st Duc de Normandie and Poppa of Normandy de Valois.1 She married Guillaume III, Duc d'Aquitaine, son of Ebalus, Duc d'Aquitaine, in 935.1 S
1 CONC he died after 14 October 962 in France.1
