0 @N6000000003232674064@ NOTE Alias:<ALIA> Alfhild or Ashild Ringsdottir/
1 CONT Both Per Nermo and Tom Bjrnstad,  Norwegian genealogists list children under this mother: Ashild Dagsdohter of Ringerike. But Brian Tompsett, UK genealogist lists their mother as: Snaefrid (Snowfair) Swasisdottir as listed in HEIM
1 CONC SKRINGLA.  Bjørnstad feels that Ashild of Ringerike is more probable since her son Sigurd inherited the throne of Ringerike. Snaefrid and her family are more legendary (family of wizards).
