1 CONT His Sword Was Named Kvernbit (Grinding-Stone Cutter) Said To Be The Best Weapon In Norway Said To Have Been Born When His Father Was About 70 Years Old
1 CONT Youngest Of Konungr Harald Fairhairs' Sons
1 CONT
1 CONT Alias:<ALIA> Hákon /Adalsteinsfostre/, Hákon the Good
1 CONT According to Tom Bjørnstad, Norwegian genealogist
1 CONT (http://home.ringnett.no/bjornstad):
1 CONT "Hákon Adalsteinsfostre (a.k.a. Hákon the Good), who got his nickname because he was brought up as a foster son by Cyning Æþelstan of England. Konungr Hákon was the first Christian king of Norway, but he failed in christening the 
1 CONC country."
