0 @N6000000002187690623@ NOTE Halfdan the Black
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Halfdan the Black Gudrødsson (820 – 860) (Old Norse: Hálfdan svarti, Norwegian: Halvdan Svarte) was the father of the first King of Norway Harald I and of the House of Yngling. According to the sagas (see external links, below), H
1 CONC alfdan was the son of King Gudröd the Hunter and Åsa, daughter of King Harald of Agder. His brother was Olaf Geirstad-Alf. When Halfdan's father was killed, Åsa took the 1 year-old Halfdan and returned to Agder, where Halfdan was 
1 CONC raised.
1 CONT
1 CONT In 838, when he was eighteen years old, Halfdan became king of Agder. He quickly began adding to his kingdom, through political negotiation and military conquest. He divided the kingdom of Vestfold with his brother Olaf and, throu
1 CONC gh military action, persuaded King Gandalf of Vingulmark to cede half his kingdom.
1 CONT
1 CONT Next, Halfdan subdued an area called Raumarike. To secure his claim to Raumarike, Halfdan first defeated and killed the previous ruler, Sigtryg Eysteinsson, in battle. He then defeated Sigtryg's brother and successor Eystein, in a
1 CONC  series of battles. This established Halfdan's claim not only to Raumarike, but also to half of Hedmark, the core of Sigtryg and Eystein's kingdom.
1 CONT
1 CONT Halfdan's first wife was Ragnhild, daughter of King Harald Gulskeg (Goldbeard) of Sogn. Halfdan and Ragnhild had a son named "Harald" after his grandfather, and they sent him to be raised in his grandfather's court. Harald Gulskeg
1 CONC , being elderly, named his grandson as his successor, shortly before his death. Ragnhild died shortly after her father, and the young king Harald fell sick and died the next spring. When Halfdan heard about his son's death, he tra
1 CONC velled to Sogn and laid claim to the title of king. No resistance was offered, and Halfdan added Sogn to his realm.
1 CONT
1 CONT The sons of Gandalf of Vingulmark, Hysing, Helsing, and Hake, attempted to ambush Halfdan at night, but he escaped into the forest. After raising an army, he returned to defeat the brothers, killing Hysing and Helsing. Hake fled t
1 CONC he country, and Halfdan became king of all of Vingulmark.
1 CONT
1 CONT Halfdan's second wife was also named Ragnhild. She was the daughter of Sigurd Hjort, king of Ringerike. She was kidnapped from her home by Hake, a "berserker" who encountered her father in Hadeland and killed him. In turn, Halfdan
1 CONC  had her kidnapped from Hake, so that he could marry her. Ragnhild and Halfdan had a son who was also named Harald.
1 CONT
1 CONT Halfdan died when he fell through the ice of lake Randsfjorden and drowned. The ice on the lake had been weakened by cattle dung, after a hole was cut in the ice for the cattle to drink. Each of the districts of his kingdom wanted
1 CONC  to claim his grave. In the end, it was agreed to divide his body into four pieces so each district could bury a piece of it, resulting in four different Halfdan's Mounds.
0 @N6000000007328859136@ NOTE Konung i Norge. Var 1 år gammal när hans fader dog. Underlade sig i
1 CONT mitten av 800-talet stora delar av Norge. Drunknade på isen i
1 CONT Randsfjorden (utanfør Bergens kust). Är begravd i Stein, Ringerike
1 CONT och platsen kallas Halvdanshaugen. Denna plats skall arkeologiskt
1 CONT undersøktes sommaren 1997. Redan førsta utgrävningsdagen hittade man
1 CONT ett vikingaskepp, vilket till storleken verkar likna andra skepp som
1 CONT man hittat i Norge. Utgrävningarna kommer att fortsätta under 1998.
1 CONT (Espell) Andra uppgifter säger att han var fødd ca 823 i Vestfold och
1 CONT død 863 i Norge.  Ätten som han tillhør kallas också Skilfingaätten.
1 CONT . Enligt den sk. Skilfingaätten i Norge skall släkten utgå från
1 CONT Ingjald Illråde i Uppsala, sex generationer tidigare än Halvdan. (se
1 CONT bla Ohlmark, Europas Furstehus s 325), uppgift av Thomas Sverker.
1 CONT Namnet Svarte brukades på grund av hans svarta hår. . Under hans tid
1 CONT var det goda skørdar, varfør undersåtarna i Ringerike, Ranerike,
1 CONT Vestfold och Hedemarken ville att han skulle høgläggas hos dem før
1 CONT att befordra fortsatt årsväxt. Man enades om att dela kroppen.
1 CONT (Lexikon)
