0 @N6000000002176675190@ NOTE In 1093 he deposed his uncle, Donald Bane, From the Scottish throne. He lived
1 CONT for a time as hostage in Normandy, but gained help from the English and
1 CONT Normans to help drive out the uncle and reclaim the throne, which he had only
1 CONT a few short months up to a year before he was killed by agents of Donald
1 CONT Bane, who was restored to the throne until 1097 when Edgar, one of the 6 sons
1 CONT of Malcolm III and Margaret, ascended the throne of Scotland.
